<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <meta name="description" content="{{ description }}" />
    <title>{{ title }} | unstiff</title>
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable-dynamic-subset.min.css"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/site.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="legal-page">
      {# Figma "WebView / Document" (4576:39975, 4576:40001): 제목·메타·구분선과
         본문이 하나의 카드 안에 들어간다. 문서 본문 typography는
         styles/input.css의 .legal-document 규칙이 담당한다. #}
      <article class="legal-document">
        <header class="legal-document-header">
          <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
          <p>v{{ version }} · {{ updatedAt }} 시행</p>
        </header>

        <div class="legal-document-body">
          {{ content | safe }}
        </div>
      </article>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
